OL,3,GNEWSAMurder inquiry over death of man
OL,4,Afound at property
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been begun
OL,7,Ffollowing the death of a man who was
OL,8,Ffound with serious injuries at a
OL,9,Fproperty.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to Wylds Lane,
OL,12,FWorcester, shortly after 21:00 BST on
OL,13,FTuesday after reports that a man had
OL,14,Fbeen found with life-threatening
OL,15,Finjuries, said West Mercia Police.
OL,17,FThe man, who police believe to be a
OL,18,F42-year-old named Damian Buczek, was
OL,19,Ftaken to hospital where he died.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
