OL,3,GNEWSAMurder inquiry over death of man
OL,4,Afound at property
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Gareth Lougher said: "This
OL,7,Fis a tragic incident which has resulted
OL,8,Fin a man losing his life, and our
OL,9,Fthoughts are with his family and loved
OL,10,Fones at this extremely difficult time."
